 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "You're leaving the car park. You put your ticket in the machine.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "But the machine just chewed it. And said: baa. There's a goat inside. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers shout: hey! Give that back!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. Shouting makes goats hungry. So it eats your wing mirror. Then your number plate. Then your tyres.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Chomp, chomp, chomp. Five minutes later, all that's left is you, your seat, and the steering wheel. And the goat? Still hungry.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Never argue with a goat. Open the glovebox, and offer it your old road map.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Munch, munch. It eats the whole of Europe. Happy goat!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "It presses the button with its nose. Barrier up!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "And now it knows every road by heart. So it hops on as your sat-nav.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "In two hundred metres, turn left. Baa!",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: a penguin parade on the motorway. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
